    {
      "title": "A New Neighbour",
      "lvl": "A2",
      "text": "Maria moved into a small flat on Monday. The rooms were bright, but the kitchen was very quiet. On Tuesday evening she heard music from the next door. She knocked and met an old man called Peter. He smiled and said sorry for the noise. Maria laughed and invited him for tea. They talked about the street, the shops and the best bus to the city centre. Now they drink tea every Friday and Maria does not feel new any more.",
