    {
      "title": "The Wrong Train",
      "lvl": "A2",
      "text": "Tom wanted to visit his cousin in York. He arrived early, bought a coffee and looked at the board. The train on platform two had York on the side, so he got on. After twenty minutes the ticket inspector asked where he was going. Tom showed his ticket and the inspector laughed kindly. The train was going to Newcastle. Tom got off at the next station, changed platform and arrived only one hour late. His cousin met him with hot soup.",
