      "title": "Cooking for Friends",
      "lvl": "A2",
      "text": "Ana invited two friends for dinner. She found an easy recipe for tomato pasta. First she boiled the water and fried some onion. Then she added tomatoes, salt and a little sugar. The kitchen smelled wonderful. Her friends came at seven with bread and juice. They ate, talked about work and washed the dishes together. Before they left, Ana wrote the recipe on a card. Everybody agreed: simple food is best with good friends.",
